==History==
2025
*{{Balance|Add}}4 [[Cards]] had Hero variants in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/12/2025)|December 2025 Update]] on 1/12/2025, those being the [[Knight]], [[Giant]], [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.]], and [[Musketeer]].
*On 22/12/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (22/12/2025)|Maintenance Break]], made it so that you will always get a new hero{{Balance|Buff}}. Additionaly only 1 Hero Slot is available in Classic 1v1s, Classic 2v2s, Classic Challenges, and Grand Challenges{{Balance|Remove}}.

2026
* {{Balance|Add}}On 5/1/2026, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/1/2026)|January 2026 Update]] allowed the [[Wizard]] and [[Ice Golem]] to have a hero form.
* {{Balance|Add}}On 2/2/2026, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/2/2026)|February 2026 Update]] allowed the [[Goblins]] and [[Mega Minion]] to have a hero form.
*On 23/2/2026 the [[Version History#2026 Q1 Update (23/2/2026)|2026 Q1 Update]], moved the hero slot to arena 5{{Balance|Neutral}}.  This also removed the Hero Box{{Balance|Remove}}.
* {{Balance|Add}} On 2/3/2026, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/3/2026)|March 2026 Update]] allowed the [[Barbarian Barrel]] and [[Magic Archer]] to have a hero form.
* On 16/3/2026 the [[Version History#2026 Mid-March Update (16/3/2026)|2026 Mid-March Update]], made it so you can chose the hero (instead of random){{Balance|Buff}} . This also changed the format of Evolution and Hero slots into one Evolution, one Hero and one Wild (from 2 evo and 2 hero){{Balance|Neutral}} .
* {{Balance|Add}} On 6/4/2026, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/4/2026)|April 2026 Update]] allowed the [[Balloon]] to have a hero form.
* {{Balance|Add}} On 4/5/2026, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (4/5/2026)|May 2026 Update]] allowed the [[Dark Prince]] and [[Bowler]] to have a hero form.
* {{Balance|Add}} On 1/6/2026, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/6/2026)|June 2026 Update]] allowed the [[Tombstone]] to have a hero form.
* {{Balance|Add}} On 3/8/2026, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (3/8/2026)|August 2026 Update]] allowed the [[Berserker]] and [[Valkyrie]] to have a hero form.
* {{Balance|Nerf}} On 4/8/2026 the [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2026)|Balance Update]] made every ability single-use

==Trivia==
*Heroes have the same defeat sound effect as [[Card Evolution|Evolutions]] and also leave similar puddles, except that they're colored golden.
*Every new seasons arrived, the previous season newest Heroes' golden glowing eyes will replaced with white sclera with golden pupils (but some exceptions like the [[Ice Golem]] and [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.]]). 

